Relicensed source (authorized)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The record-chain and audit-segment code and their tests were extracted from the
Open Agentic Platform (OAP), `crates/policy-kernel` (`proof_chain.rs` and the
pure subset of `audit.rs`), where they carry an SPDX header reading
`AGPL-3.0-or-later`. Relicensing this extracted source to Apache-2.0 is the
prerogative of the sole copyright holder (Bartek Kus) and is an explicit,
authorized act.

The extraction is domain-neutral by construction: the chain, signing, and verify
mechanics hold no Open Agentic Platform domain logic. The OAP-specific fields
that were baked into the original proof record (`policy_bundle_hash`,
`rule_ids`, `decision`, `privilege_level`) are not part of this library; they
move into the opaque `payload` of consumers that want them. The OAP-specific
file writer and rotation logic (an OAP persistence choice) were not extracted.

