Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Reproducible record hashing rests on `canonical-keysort-json`, itself extracted
and relicensed Apache-2.0 from OAP's `crates/canonical-json`.

A forthcoming OAP extraction spec (analogous to spec 219 for tenant-tail)
formalizes the vend; the interim record is
`chancery/docs/preliminary/00-extraction-overview.md` and `01-attest-ledger.md`.
